{
  "meta": {
    "package": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG.pcc",
    "stem": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG",
    "textLang": "INT",
    "sets": 1
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105308",
      "en": "Witnesses saw you making threats in Fist's bar. Stay away from him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105309",
      "en": "I don't take orders from you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105310",
      "en": "Last I heard, Fist still had her. Probably somewhere inside his club. You help me kill Fist, she's all yours.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105311",
      "en": "Can't tell you much. All I got was a coded message with the details of the job. Standard procedure.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105312",
      "en": "What about Garrus? That turian? He wants to take Saren down, too.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105313",
      "en": "He was here just before you showed up. Said he was going to follow up a lead on his investigation. Wanted to speak to the doctor at the med clinic.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105314",
      "en": "This is your only warning, Wrex.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105315",
      "en": "You should warn Fist. I will kill him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105316",
      "en": "You want me to arrest you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105317",
      "en": "I want you to try.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105318",
      "en": "Go on. Get out of here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105319",
      "en": "Do I know you, human?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105320",
      "en": "Shepard? Commander Shepard? I've heard a lot about you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105321",
      "en": "Now I recognize you. Commander Shepard, from the Alliance. I've heard a lot about you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105322",
      "en": "We're both warriors, Shepard. Out of respect, I'll give you fair warning. I'm going to kill Fist.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105323",
      "en": "Fist knows you're coming. We'll have a better chance if we all work together.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105324",
      "en": "Fist knows you're coming. We'll have a better chance if we all work together.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105325",
      "en": "Fist knows you're coming. We'll have a better chance if we all work together.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105326",
      "en": "My people have a saying: Seek the enemy of your enemy, and you will find a friend.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105327",
      "en": "Let's go. I hate to keep Fist waiting.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105328",
      "en": "Yes, human?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105329",
      "en": "Barla Von is a wise man. We may share a common goal, human.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105330",
      "en": "Hah! I like you, Shepard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105331",
      "en": "I've been hired to kill the owner of Chora's Den. A man named Fist. He did something very foolish.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105332",
      "en": "He betrayed the Shadow Broker.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105333",
      "en": "A quarian showed up here on the Citadel. She was on the run. She wanted to trade information for a safe place to hide, so she went to Fist.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105334",
      "en": "He promised to arrange a meeting between her and the Shadow Broker. Instead, he contacted Saren.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105335",
      "en": "Well, the quarian has something that connects Saren to the geth. He paid Fist a small fortune for her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105336",
      "en": "He's just greedy. Saren paid him a small fortune for the quarian. He had to. She has evidence connecting him to the geth.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105337",
      "en": "If we get our hands on that evidence, we can prove that Saren's a traitor! The Council will have to listen to us.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105340",
      "en": "What does Saren have to do with this?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105342",
      "en": "Fist's not too smart.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105344",
      "en": "Saren might already have her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105345",
      "en": "Where's the quarian now?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105346",
      "en": "I want to know more about your employer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105348",
      "en": "Time we paid Fist a visit.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105349",
      "en": "He might come in handy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105350",
      "en": "Move out!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105351",
      "en": "We can handle this on our own.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105357",
      "en": "My name's Shepard. I'm going after Fist. Thought you might want to come along.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105359",
      "en": "I'm going after Fist. I don't want you getting in my way.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105365",
      "en": "Does this mean you're part of my team, Wrex?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105366",
      "en": "Glad to have you on the team, Wrex.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105367",
      "en": "I think we're going to get along just fine, Wrex.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105368",
      "en": "I'm trying to bring down Saren. Barla Von said to talk to you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105369",
      "en": "Spit it out. Or are you trying to build suspense?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105371",
      "en": "Enlighten me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105372",
      "en": "What did he do?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105374",
      "en": "He betrayed the Shadow Broker.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105383",
      "en": "My name's Shepard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105384",
      "en": "You will.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105385",
      "en": "Fist is mine!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105392",
      "en": "So you'll join?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105393",
      "en": "Welcome aboard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105394",
      "en": "I like that saying.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105395",
      "en": "You can help me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105396",
      "en": "We need to talk.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105397",
      "en": "Wrex?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105398",
      "en": "How so?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105399",
      "en": "Get to the point.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105400",
      "en": "What goal?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105402",
      "en": "Tell me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105403",
      "en": "Let me guess.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105406",
      "en": "Why?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105407",
      "en": "Big mistake.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105410",
      "en": "We might be too late.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105411",
      "en": "I have to find her!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105412",
      "en": "What about the Shadow Broker?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105413",
      "en": "It's a deal.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105415",
      "en": "We could use him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105416",
      "en": "We don't need him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_01_DSG|sta30_krogan_cutscene_D|105417",
      "en": "Let's go.",
      "tr": ""
    }
  ]
}